      "name": "EBD About Ingredients",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Clean, Unique Ingredients",
        "text": "<p>You can only tackle life's biggest waves when your body and mind are fueled with the most vitalizing ingredients on earth. That’s why every product we make is loaded with natural plant-powered goodness including functional mushrooms, adaptogens, minerals and more.</p>",
